comments[7]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-12T02:47:19.822Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: all-status searches for PM-CLI-31, graph-composition not found, linked-test Sentry environment, test telemetry pollution, and unclassified assurance faults found analogous closed classifiers pm-qyg51h and pm-v0a0un plus the open observability join pm-23lmm5, but no owner for linked-test child environment classification. Privacy-safe live evidence: one high handled event on release 2026.8.11 at 2026-08-12T01:23:55Z exactly matches the failed pm-cg1sjb linked-test run ending 2026-08-12T01:23:55.900Z; no raw event id, host, endpoint, or credential is stored."
  "2026-08-12T02:52:08.259Z","harness:codex","TDD evidence: the new real-child regression first failed with inherited outputs [production, staging], proving a production parent polluted the default child while an explicit per-test override already won. After defaulting the composed linked-child environment to SENTRY_ENVIRONMENT=test before run-level/per-test directives, the same focused suite passed 59/59. Public configuration docs now state the isolation and override contract."
  "2026-08-12T03:34:23.471Z","harness:codex","Verification evidence: focused linked-test suite passed 59/59; full coverage passed 486 files and 7,244 tests at exact 100/100/100/100; repo-wide lint, typecheck, contracts, secrets, docs links, SDK surface, artifact, packed npx smoke, and 88-command package-first dogfood passed. Manual temporary-project acceptance at /tmp/tmp.HijJL720QZ proved a production parent defaults its linked child to SENTRY_ENVIRONMENT=test while explicit overrides remain supported. Sentry PM-CLI-31 remains the release blocker until the fix is merged and the issue is dispositioned."
  "2026-08-12T03:36:06.177Z","harness:codex","Delivery surface: GitHub PR #986 https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/986 carries the linked-child Sentry isolation fix. Keep this item claimed and in progress through exact-head checks, bot review, merge, Sentry disposition, and release proof."
  "2026-08-12T03:44:06.332Z","harness:codex","Review feedback: Sourcery correctly identified that the regression proved default and per-test Sentry precedence but not the documented run-level layer. Extended the same real-child test to rerun with run-level SENTRY_ENVIRONMENT=acceptance and prove outputs [acceptance, staging], covering default < run-level < per-test precedence without a duplicate fixture."
  "2026-08-12T03:58:29.592Z","harness:codex","Merged and external evidence: PR #986 exact reviewed head 3d94e70dc merged as a817c09ef after every hosted check passed, the one actionable Sourcery test gap was fixed, all bot surfaces were reacted to and answered, and no review thread remained. PM-CLI-31 was re-read live, confirmed as the single pre-fix linked sandbox event, and resolved in the next release. Authenticated Sentry gate now reports 0 critical and 0 high."
  "2026-08-12T04:37:02.878Z","harness:codex","Published release proof: Auto Release run 31562347323 created the sole v2026.8.12 tag at 152a854d2 and downstream Release run 31562866075 passed. GitHub release is public and npm latest is 2026.8.12. Independent verifier passed npm metadata, npx/bunx pm + package-default + pm-mcp dispatch, bin coverage, and missing-bin negative controls in one attempt. Cold installed-agent acceptance passed 10/10 lifecycle steps under both npm and Bun. Required live gate passed Sentry critical=0/high=0 and telemetry finish_error_rate=1.53% with zero failures missing error codes; local telemetry flush drained 2 to 0."
